OL,3,GNEWSAGood boy Gunner helps sniff out
OL,4,Aweapons in park
OL,5,
OL,6,FA specialist knife detection dog helped
OL,7,Frecover three weapons during a police
OL,8,Foperation in a park.
OL,10,FNorthamptonshire Police called on the
OL,11,Fhelp of Gunner to help remove two
OL,12,Ffolding knives and a screwdriver from
OL,13,Fthe park in Rushden earlier this month.
OL,15,FGunner is one of a small number of
OL,16,Fknife detection dogs nationally and is
OL,17,Ftrained to identify a specific scent
OL,18,Fleft on metal objects after contact
OL,19,Fwith human skin.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
