OL,3,GNEWSAGood boy Gunner helps sniff out
OL,4,Aweapons in park
OL,5,
OL,6,F"By using innovative tactics, it can
OL,7,Fhelp to identify and remove dangerous
OL,8,Fweapons before they are used," said Sgt
OL,9,FLeigh Francoise Goodwin.
